  "goodToKnow": "Die Altlast, usually plural, is a contaminated site, soil or groundwater polluted by former industry, landfill or military use. Cleaning up Altlasten (Altlastensanierung) was a huge task in eastern Germany after 1990. Figuratively, Altlasten are inherited problems: Die Firma kämpft mit Altlasten. Die Last means burden or load. Plural: die Altlasten."
